                                                "sense_id": "587c5638-89d0-3fe9-9c8b-2d8ff287f84d",
                                                "text": "But critics of the law said mothers who immediately kill their babies after giving birth, a practice known as neonaticide, are usually in deep denial about their pregnancies."
                                            }
